## Alerts

{% alert info %}
This is an info alert. It provides helpful information.
{% endalert %}

{% alert warning %}
This is a warning alert. Proceed with caution.
{% endalert %}

{% alert error %}
This is an error alert. Something went wrong.
{% endalert %}

{% alert success %}
